  <item>
    <title>我从小的梦想就是开一家花店 ||ep04</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6381eb64f6753f4e9d4d583b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6381eb64f6753f4e9d4d583b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Nov 2022 10:33:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在大学开首家线上花店？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这段时间，我们在埋头干大事，归来「惊艳」所有人！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>highlights:</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> “你好，我买了花，桶是送的吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 上帝在创造你的时候，加几勺温柔，加几勺审美，加几勺酷炫——手抖了，加了一瓶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> “听说你在搞小生意还是在创业啊？需不需要我投资？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 想做就大胆去吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 卖花和卖烧烤，都可以很迷人</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>---干货向目录---</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 花种、价格、是否盈利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 大学里开线上花店的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a> 是否有市场</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 所需要做的主要工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 每周的周期性工作流程</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 开线上花店对心态和生活的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 其他人对卖花的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 印象最深刻的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 给同样有开校园线上花店想法的同学的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> 给其他小伙伴养护花花的建议</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>「我先是花朵，世界才是花园」</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>大学，试错成本很低的地方，唯一一个穿什么衣服都不会觉得奇怪的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>JZTV将持续为您报道。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Notice!</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期播客不含任何广告</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>养花和卖花为个人经验，仅供参考</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即兴发挥没有底稿，表述逻辑不清见谅</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv8xHTWQbYRIVryaJgIW2SdniYdM.m4a" length="51003364" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoUUdVNjdjQXRHNzc3WlpMS0JHQnBwN3hMNTMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我却想做60%的大人 ||ep03.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f50f9a226f5c1fa0d58678</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f50f9a226f5c1fa0d58678</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Aug 2022 14:17:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>实习、染头烫头、美甲美睫、晚回家自由与恋爱自由……</span><br><span>在从大学生变成大人的路上，我们都经历了无数的反抗与屈服。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">1:08</a> 一切所有不用动脑子的事情都变得有趣了起来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">8:42</a> 责任心的前提当然是归属感啦！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 上班和演戏没有本质区别</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> “你看起来年纪不大吧?”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> &nbsp;”大人”、能力、责任与我们想要的权力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 可能爸爸妈妈只是在装糊涂——</span></p><span></span><p><span>一颗炫彩螺丝钉，和一个想做布丁的补丁，以冰红茶代酒，共吐苦水。</span><br><span>我们其实也想不明白，却试图装作明白。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgb7dC7Y5YbTQslrgzQUsDmSUH-s.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk5Ty7YUAPbZdkqF9eQdZHKIN-QD.m4a" length="49155989" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwRjBadFBFb2JDUDJHdDVoelBYTW1TTG9lUl8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>你你你你想独居吗？||ep02.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c195b1ffa3b62fed6a9ca1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c195b1ffa3b62fed6a9ca1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Jul 2022 13:12:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>激动到结巴，所以，</span><strong><span>“你你你你想独居吗？”</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 机智的女大学生</span><strong><span>生「存」</span></strong></h1><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 在独居生活里 </span><strong><span>「自制」</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>「自治」</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 独居里频繁更动态，想割裂又想融入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 我真的好喜欢我的那把梳子，我不想任何一把别的梳子替代它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 有的人永远在等着你，接住你的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 在四人寝里过四人同居的生活数不胜数，</span><strong><span>在四人寝里过独居的生活屈指可数</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FjAb5yBaI6GEuDzEMkdMiUpgbKXV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>——暑假来啦，呆呆和程程带来了</span><strong><span>“你你你你”</span></strong><span>合集。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li29svW-LVn8KWilCNATZ0Vh01sy.m4a" length="21329609" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvS2NxN1dmRkNSV3RkckxRUVhlbDVyTTBybTEucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
